# This tree is edited from both WSL and Windows: without a repo-level ending
# policy, a Windows-side git (core.autocrlf=true by default) rewrites every
# text file to CRLF and the whole tree shows as modified, and byte-sensitive
# tools (hash pins, freshness gates) false-positive on EOL alone. Pin LF
# everywhere; text=auto still leaves binaries alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
